    "intro": {
      "zh": "PlayStation 2 是索尼 2000 年发布的第六代家用游戏机，搭载 Emotion Engine 处理器与 DVD 播放功能，凭借庞大的游戏库与影音播放能力成为史上销量最高的游戏机。它是游戏机厅第六代主机「DVD 助推普及」叙事线的核心锚点，也是一代人的客厅娱乐记忆。",
      "en": "The PlayStation 2, released by Sony in 2000, was a sixth-generation home console powered by the Emotion Engine and featuring DVD playback, becoming the best-selling game console in history through its vast game library and multimedia capabilities."
    },
    "era": 2000,
    "manufacturer": "Sony"
  },
